      "problem": "Given $w=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 2 \\\\ \\sqrt{10}\\end{aligned}]$, find $‖w‖.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the formula for the norm, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖w‖ & =\\sqrt{{w}_{1}^{2}+{w}_{2}^{2}+{w}_{3}^{2}+{w}_{4}^{2}+{w}_{5}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-2)^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{9}^{2}+{2}^{2}+(\\sqrt{10})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+1+81+4+10} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{100} \\\\  & =10.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
